# A row of four cells on dark ink (bg:p.ink), cells 48 px wide, each a small gold dot of radius 4 with fx glow 3 in pale gold at a:1. Only strength: changes, left to right.
# 1. strength 0: the bare gold dot with no halo at all.
# 2. no strength (the default, 1): the dot with a thin faint halo, 1 to 2 px of visible gold before it fades into the ink.
# 3. strength:3: the same halo much brighter, a clearly lit gold ring around the dot that fades out over a few px.
# 4. strength:12: an opaque pale gold disc around the dot, with a short soft edge. It ends about where the halos of cells 2 and 3 end, no wider.
@artboard 192x48
@target fx/glow-strength.png bg:p.ink

circle 4 at:24,24 fill:p.gold
  fx glow 3 color:p.gold.4 a:1 strength:0
circle 4 at:72,24 fill:p.gold
  fx glow 3 color:p.gold.4 a:1
circle 4 at:120,24 fill:p.gold
  fx glow 3 color:p.gold.4 a:1 strength:3
circle 4 at:168,24 fill:p.gold
  fx glow 3 color:p.gold.4 a:1 strength:12
